## 4. Common Operations

### 4.1 Deployment
```bash
# Standard deployment
helm upgrade --install {{serviceName}} ./helm \
  --namespace {{namespace}} \
  --set image.tag={{version}} \
  --wait --timeout=300s

# Verify
kubectl rollout status deployment/{{serviceName}} -n {{namespace}}
```

### 4.2 Rollback
```bash
# Quick rollback (last revision)
helm rollback {{serviceName}} -n {{namespace}}

# Rollback to specific revision
helm rollback {{serviceName}} {{revision}} -n {{namespace}}

# Verify
kubectl rollout status deployment/{{serviceName}} -n {{namespace}}
```

### 4.3 Scaling
```bash
# Manual scale
kubectl scale deployment {{serviceName}} --replicas={{replicas}} -n {{namespace}}

# HPA is configured for automatic scaling
```

### 4.4 Database Migrations
```bash
# Run migrations
kubectl run migration-job --image={{migrationImage}} --restart=Never \
  -n {{namespace}} -- {{migrationCommand}}

# Check status
kubectl logs migration-job -n {{namespace}}
```

