## 6. Disaster Recovery

### 6.1 Regional Failover
```bash
# Failover to secondary region
kubectl config use-context {{secondaryRegion}}
helm upgrade --install {{serviceName}} ./helm \
  --namespace {{namespace}} \
  --set replicaCount={{drReplicas}} \
  --wait --timeout=300s

# Update DNS
# (Automated via health checks or manual)
```

### 6.2 Data Recovery
```bash
# Restore from backup
# 1. Identify backup timestamp
# 2. Restore database
pg_restore -h {{dbHost}} -U {{dbUser}} -d {{dbName}} {{backupFile}}

# 3. Verify data integrity
# 4. Run smoke tests
```

### 6.3 Complete Rebuild
```bash
# 1. Provision infrastructure
terraform apply -target=module.{{serviceName}}

# 2. Deploy application
helm install {{serviceName}} ./helm -n {{namespace}}

# 3. Restore data
# 4. Verify all systems
```

